00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:26.080
They're requesting immediate support!

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:31.270
Mysteria Friends

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.080
Madam President!

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:35.750
Academy Down

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:14.710
Um...

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.170
Do you remember where to evacuate?

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:20.170
Yeah.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.880
Then you should get moving.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:22.830
Right!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.460
Thanks for saving us!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.250
Grea...

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.540
Please don't forget the 
duty you've been assigned.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.640
But...!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.540
I'm so sorry, Anne.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:49.330
Why? Why am I the only one?

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:54.210
The fall of the medical building
was completely unexpected.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.580
So what happened to the students inside?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.460
How much medical supplies do we have on hand?

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:00.880
I'll go and check.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.410
Take anything that's left to the auditorium.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.630
Understood!

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:07.040
How many students are still left
inside the buildings on campus?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.170
We don't have accurate numbers,
but we suspect quite a few.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.540
I see.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.080
What would the princess do if she was here?

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.420
Madam President...

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.080
I'm learning just how powerless I really am.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.000
The auditorium has been taken over!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.460
What happened?

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.130
I'll go check it out!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:25.800
Don't leave your post!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.080
Start gathering the supplies!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.560
The defense team was totally wiped out!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.680
The barrier has been taken down,


00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.230
