00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.460
Madam President... shall 
we form a rescue team?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.460
Are you saying we should 
just leave them there?!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:41.750
Are you saying we should 
just leave them there?!

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.250
