out there just to die!

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:44.460
New orders!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.490
Wait!

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.700
If we send any more people out there,
it's just going to make things worse.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.210
You're going to abandon them?

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.580
We will give up on the southern building
and abandon this one as well!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.520
Every section should gather the things they need


00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.270
and proceed to the bridge gate immediately!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:11.630
Okay, please go and raise the barrier
for the grand staircase.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.890
This means that over half the school
will have been lost...

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.980
It seems the barrier at the
grand staircase is still intact.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.990
The main building is also still 
holding out at this point.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.250
The only question now is how many
will be able to flee and make it here.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.000
I'm going to watch over the east gate.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Should we send over some support
to the library as well?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.580
Everyone else is fighting out there...

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.330
Shall we go?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.710
I'm going, too!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:50.750
Please, we need you to 
respect everyone's wishes.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.830
But...!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.750
That's just not fair...

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.540
There's still this many left?

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:22.540
Grea!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.290
I'm so glad to see that you're okay!

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.290
I'm sorry, I couldn't hold them off...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.460
There's still more for you to do.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.000
You're willing to help, right?

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:51.830
Princess.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:05.420
I shall go with you.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.960
Please separate yourselves by assigned color!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.820
Keep your line as straight as you can!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.790
We'll make our stand just 
outside the bridge gate!

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.560
Hold them back for as long as you can!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.810
No matter what, we need to keep
the monsters within the school grounds!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.800
Is the bridge gate ready to be shut?

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:21.810
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.210
Hurry! Please move quickly!

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.960
Please make haste! We're 
going to shut the gate!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.710
What happened?!

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.290
What... is that?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.250
Where'd it come from?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.580
I've never seen anything like it!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.750
Is the president okay?!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.540
What should we do?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.040
This isn't good!

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:33.390
Grea!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.920
P-Princess?!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:53.830
Where, where?

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.380
What is she doing here?

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.120
Princess? Why did you come here?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.170
Anne?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:05.380
Hey! Just what do you think
you're doing to my Grea?!

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.550
How barbaric.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.130
Schweinshaxe!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.070
That did it!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.780
What does she think she's doing?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.380
What's going on? What was that?

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.790
That must've been Anne...

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.790
The drill is over! We're finished!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:28.630
I guess they're calling it off...

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.920
Why? What happened?

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.250
I heard there was a golem.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:31.960
No way!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.220
I wonder... if that can be fixed?

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.500
The evacuation drill is now finished.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:43.920
I suspect... it can't.
The evacuation drill is now finished.

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.580
I suspect... it can't.
Everyone except students responsible for repairs

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.170
Everyone except students 
responsible for repairs

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.290
should report to the
communications building immediately.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.460
You may then leave school 
for the day. I repeat...

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.320
Good grief!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.330
Do you not know how to hold back at all?

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.420
If the princess had just 
remained an observer,

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.370
there wouldn't have been
so much damage to the school.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:08.040
That's why we said you were
supposed to stay put, Anne.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.080
Hanna.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.040
Yes?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.420
Regarding the response 
we saw during the drill,

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.050
it seems breaks in the chain of
command are a big problem.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.470
When responding to unforeseen situations,

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.050
it's necessary to make the 
right calls under pressure.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:23.220
Firstly, you should have set 
the line of defense at the

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.610
bridge gate to secure the 
evacuation route and-

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.960
Can we still fix this?

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.540
I suspect... we can't.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:45.580
It seems the school will 
be closed for a while...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 6
Floating at Sea

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:40.790
Mysteria Friends, episode 
6: "Floating at Sea."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.010
Illustration by: Yoh Yoshinari

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.520
And so it was decided that the students would
practice a defensive drill all on their own.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.270
Wow, that sounds fun!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:58.110
To be more specific, all students will 
evacuate through the bridge gate

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.440
to the communications building.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.040
All while monsters are assaulting the school.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.500
The teachers will be providing us
with the dummy monsters.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:11.040
We're going to pump out a lot of them,
so make sure to keep on your toes!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.330
I haven't really put my magic to use lately,
so I'm really excited!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.170
Oh, I'm okay taking on any sort of monster!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.780
I'm sure I can take anything 
down in just one hit!

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:24.180
Well, Princess... about that...

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.250
Huh?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:29.470
For this drill, we would like to have you
act just as an observer.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.750
Huh? An "observer"?

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.000
The purpose of this drill is to be
beneficial for the students.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.880
And by that you mean...?

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.360
That we would like you to refrain from
any direct participation.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.530
Huh?

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.610
Many think that with you 
there, the students will rely

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.760
on your skills and learn 
nothing for themselves.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.740
Yeah, but what's wrong with that?

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.750
Well, Anne, we all know your 
magic is particularly strong,

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.080
so it's possible you'll blow 
up the grounds entirely.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.340
I'm not going to blow up anything...

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.640
The student council has 
also agreed to the idea of

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:05.300
only having students 
participate in the drill.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.050
But I'm a student, too...

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:11.060
Come on! I promise I won't 
cause any problems. Please!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:16.520
Princess, on the day of the drill, please refrain
from taking any action or offering any help.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.130
Grea...

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:22.880
Oh, we would like for Grea to participate
as a member of the interception group.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.650
Oh, um, sure. I'll do my best.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:31.000
That's not fair! I want to 
participate in the drill, too!
